ive. LG AI Research Institute is expanding the mega AI 'ExaOne' ecosystem through the 'Expert AI' strategy that solves real-world industrial challenges. LG has developed its own model 'K-Exaone 1 (KX1)' and a lightweight model 'Exaone 5' and is applying them to various industrial fields such as manufacturing, finance, and medical care."